      "value": "<h2><em>Rank 2 Ki Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong> 12 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> None</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong> 1 Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong> 120 Feet</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> Barrage</li>\n</ul>\n<p>A small beam shot from the finger. Roll a <em>Barrage Attack Roll</em> dealing 2d6 <em>Ki Damage</em> on a hit. After casting this you may, as a Bonus Action, fire an additional <em>Death Beam</em> for half the initial <strong>Ki Cost</strong>.</p>\n",
